[options]
[A.]
<$Playsound,thunderCannonRoar.wav>
                 <h2>Slave to the King (Attack on Thunder Village)<a href="#mission9">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                                                 ~[IthunderFactory.3]
<br>                                                                                                  ~1~y<?!{sw_difficulty1}>HARD</?><?{sw_difficulty1}>EASY</?>~.<br>
<i>There is nothing quite like the roar of a Thunder Cannon<br>
                                                   ---Warrior of Thunder Village</i>
<br>
After your last mission the {sw_god5} was exuberant. However,
 he still wants the power of Thunder! You must venture to the Thunder
  Village and sac everyone you can in the name of Hades.
<p>
<i>"Bring me more souls!"</i> cries the King as you climb aboard your island.
Just as you are landing on Thunder Village you hear a loud crash. ~I"What
 in the world?"~., you think to yourself."
<p>
It is Sham the Henchman. His pilot has just crashed his island into yours.
 During the crash you noticed a shape fall from the island.
 It was Sham and he landed right onto a Thunder Warrior's Island.
 Now you must rescue him!
<p>
            <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                                                   <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                                             <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
<a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Review Knowledge</a>                           <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">Let's save Sham!</a>                               <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">Outta here!</a>
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,golemMove2.wav
$Button= ,Tell,A.


[ai7PriestDead]
Another Priest has fallen before you; his soul sent forevermore to the
BOWELS OF ~[IsunFlyerBomb.0]~r~BHELL~[IsunFlyerBomb.2]
<p>
King {sw_hades} is pleased! He grants you knowledge...
$Menu=~[IthunderBattery.*]~yThunder Battery,GetTechnology,77

[ai6PriestDead]
You've been granted the most powerful of all weapons! The coveted Thunder Cannon!
$Menu=~yThunder Cannon~[IthunderCannon.16],GetTechnology,131

[ai8PriestDead]
One more Priest sacrificed. The <br>
{sw_god5} is very pleased!
<$ChangeMoney,1500>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[ai4PriestDead]
It has been rumored that the Storm Crystals that fall from the heavens are
actually tears of joy from the Furies....
<p>
If that's so, then the {sw_god5} must be esctatic over another lost soul sent
to him - for the Storm Crystals have just poured down from the heavens...
<p>
You shudder as you think of what endless torture these hapless victims will
experience..
<p>
Oh well. Better them than you!
<$ChangeMoney,5000>
$Button=Continue,DoNothing,0

[ai5PriestCaptured]
Sham, a henchman of<br>
{sw_hades} calls out to you:<br>
<i>"In the name of Hades you must save me!"</i>
$Button=I'll try,DoNothing,0
                       
[ai5PriestDead]
<i>"Hades will be furious if you fail him now!</i>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[ai2TempleHalfDead]
<i>Have mercy young Warrior!<br>
                    --Thor</i>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[ai2TempleDead]
The thunder King pleads with you:<br>
<i>"I beg you! I will train you in the knowledge of Thunder."</i>
<p>
You think to yourself: Hum! Not! Hades would be furious. Plus he will teach me.
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[ai2PriestCaptured]
<i>"Please!"</i>, the thunder King wails, <i>"Don't sacrifice me. Together
we can fight Hades and rule the Skies!"</i>
<p>
~I"Shutup old fool and bow before the spirit of Hades!"~., you cry
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[ai2PriestDead]
~I"Hah! Oppose the God of ~kDEATH~.~I? I think not!"
<$ChangeMoney,1250>
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
A giant rumbling begins, and your island shakes uncontrollably!
Flames erupt from Nimbus and shoot up high into the Stratosphere, all
around your island! Instantly you gasp for breath, but your lungs feel
like they are burning inside your chest! You fall to your knees, unable
to breathe!
<p>
A moment later, you can breathe again, as the flames subside, as does the
skaing.
<p>
The God of {sw_hades} appears before you. He laughs with glee.
"GET UP, groveler. You have done well.."<br>
"Did you like the show I put on for you? You have made me very happy - so far.
Now continue with your destruction. Attack Sun City!"
<p>
You stammer, ~I"Ya...Yes, Ma..Ma.. Master. I will obey!"~.
<$Config,sw_m10=1>
<$Config,sw_m9=0>
$Button=Let's Go!,MissionBegin,sw_m10


[Failed]
You receive a message from the King of Thunder Village.<br>
<i>"Run back to your master, you poor excuse for a Nimbian warrior!"</i>
<p>
But you can't run because Hades demands souls and knowledge. You must try again.
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=1>
<$Config,sw_mvar0=4000>
<$Config,sw_mvar2=7>
<$Config,sw_mvar1=0>
$Button=Try Again,MissionBegin,sw_m9

[END]
